    <p style="word-spacing: 0; line-height: 100%; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0"><font face="Arial" color="#F2D297" size="2"><b>I
    - </b>Pessoas, coisas, dias - <i>Tarso de Melo</i></font><span style="mso-bidi-font-size:10.0pt;font-family:Arial;color:navy"></o:p>
    </span>
    </p>
